		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New Alpha 2024 06 23]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4171&amp;p=31750#p31750"><![CDATA[
A new Alpha version is avalable for MD2017/RT-82<br><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/MD2017/Firmware/6f8951e8267bc5f4190fa772e77322765b995f6a_2" class="postlink">downloads/MD2017/Firmware/6f8951e8267bc ... 5b995f6a_2</a><br><br><br><span style="font-size:150%;line-height:116%">EDIT.<br><br>This version appears to have problems then used with simplex hotspots.  <br>If you experience any problems with this version please download the previous beta and reinstall</span><br><br>Changes in this version<br><br>* Add Hotspot SMS passthrough function - Thanks for multiple authors including DL4LEX and Daniel for incorporating this change.<br>* Reinstate Private call alarm beep<br>* Add safe boot functionality (minimum functionality boot)<br>* Fix Hotspot echo bug and change hotspot version number<br>* Disable battery RAM to increase battery life<br>* Fix DTMF tone cancellation problem<br>* Fix TimeSlot detection and synchronisation when TimeSlot filter is disabled<br>* Fix bug with edit cursor problems<br>* Fix voltage history plotting bug<br>* Fix phantom PTT tiggering bug<br>* Changes to hardware debug screen<br><br>Thanks to Daniel F1RMB for this update<br><br><br>Edit.<br><br>I made a mistake with the integration of the language translation files into the .zip file.<br><br>I've now rebuilt all the .gla files, which are in the .zip file and updated the link<br><br>If you already downloaded the firmware and are using a language other than English, please download again and use the updated version<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Jun 23, 2024 9:47 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
